2773\">Une mont\u00e9e en comp\u00e9tences rapide<\/li><li data-section-id=\"izyen1\" data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2813\">Une forte orientation technologique<\/li><li data-section-id=\"1xocczj\" data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2841\">Une grande adaptabilit\u00e9<\/li><li data-section-id=\"2nlrzl\" data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2885\">Une capacit\u00e9 \u00e0 travailler en distanciel<\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2922\">Les domaines d\u2019expertise incluent :<\/p><ul data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"3045\"><li data-section-id=\"1vn2t27\" data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"2944\">D\u00e9veloppement IT<\/li><li data-section-id=\"10v7mb4\" data-start=\"2945\" data-end=\"2967\">Analyse de donn\u00e9es<\/li><li data-section-id=\"a6c053\" data-start=\"2968\" data-end=\"2987\">Relation client<\/li><li data-section-id=\"g60hdi\" data-start=\"2988\" data-end=\"3009\">Marketing digital<\/li><li data-section-id=\"flt14k\" data-start=\"3010\" data-end=\"3045\">Fonctions support externalis\u00e9es<\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"3047\" data-end=\"3225\"><strong data-start=\"3047\" data-end=\"3104\">Pourquoi les talents africains sont-ils comp\u00e9titifs ?<\/strong><br data-start=\"3104\" data-end=\"3107\" \/>Ils combinent comp\u00e9tences techniques, agilit\u00e9 et engagement, offrant un excellent \u00e9quilibre entre performance et co\u00fbt.<\/p><h2 data-section-id=\"1379lrd\" data-start=\"3232\" data-end=\"3267\">Benchmark des salaires au Rwanda<\/h2><p data-start=\"3269\" data-end=\"3319\">Quels sont les niveaux de r\u00e9mun\u00e9ration pratiqu\u00e9s ?<\/p><p data-start=\"3321\" data-end=\"3449\">Les salaires varient selon l\u2019exp\u00e9rience, le secteur et les responsabilit\u00e9s. Voici des fourchettes mensuelles estim\u00e9es en euros :<\/p><h3 data-section-id=\"1a9yzxs\" data-start=\"3451\" data-end=\"3469\">Support client<\/h3><ul data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3589\"><li data-section-id=\"v7uwh5\" data-start=\"3470\" data-end=\"3507\">D\u00e9butant : <strong data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3505\">350 \u2013 550 \u20ac \/ mois<\/strong><\/li><li data-section-id=\"q07yl3\" data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3548\">Exp\u00e9riment\u00e9 : <strong data-start=\"3524\" data-end=\"3546\">550 \u2013 900 \u20ac \/ mois<\/strong><\/li><li data-section-id=\"1iqo7j4\" data-start=\"3549\" data-end=\"3589\">Team leader : <strong data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3589\">900 \u2013 1 400 \u20ac \/ mois<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><h3 data-section-id=\"1ivcjm9\" data-start=\"3591\" data-end=\"3611\">D\u00e9veloppement IT<\/h3><ul data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3756\"><li data-section-id=\"18wr3qv\" data-start=\"3612\" data-end=\"3661\">D\u00e9veloppeur junior : <strong data-start=\"3635\" data-end=\"3659\">700 \u2013 1 100 \u20ac \/ mois<\/strong><\/li><li data-section-id=\"16cqfb4\" data-start=\"3662\" data-end=\"3718\">D\u00e9veloppeur exp\u00e9riment\u00e9 : <strong data-start=\"3690\" data-end=\"3716\">1 100 \u2013 2 300 \u20ac \/ mois<\/strong><\/li><li data-section-id=\"1mgwyc2\" data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3756\">Senior : <strong data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3756\">2 300 \u2013 4 100 \u20ac \/ mois<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><h3 data-section-id=\"1wgmtmy\" data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3777\">Data et analyse<\/h3><ul data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3898\"><li data-section-id=\"7r1rk5\" data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3815\">Junior : <strong data-start=\"3789\" data-end=\"3813\">800 \u2013 1 300 \u20ac \/ mois<\/strong><\/li><li data-section-id=\"1cfuvmg\" data-start=\"3816\" data-end=\"3860\">Exp\u00e9riment\u00e9 : <strong data-start=\"3832\" data-end=\"3858\">1 300 \u2013 2 600 \u20ac \/ mois<\/strong><\/li><li data-section-id=\"ydvnrk\" data-start=\"3861\" data-end=\"3898\">Senior : <strong data-start=\"3872\" data-end=\"3898\">2 600 \u2013 4 600 \u20ac \/ mois<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><h3 data-section-id=\"n845q0\" data-start=\"3900\" data-end=\"3921\">Marketing digital<\/h3><ul data-start=\"3922\" data-end=\"4043\"><li data-section-id=\"elqc6q\" data-start=\"3922\" data-end=\"3957\">Junior : <strong data-start=\"3933\" data-end=\"3955\">500 \u2013 800 \u20ac \/ mois<\/strong><\/li><li data-section-id=\"1tgc402\" data-start=\"3958\" data-end=\"4000\">Exp\u00e9riment\u00e9 : <strong data-start=\"3974\" data-end=\"3998\">800 \u2013 1 500 \u20ac \/ mois<\/strong><\/li><li data-section-id=\"n794l2\" data-start=\"4001\" data-end=\"4043\">Responsable : <strong data-start=\"4017\" data-end=\"4043\">1 500 \u2013 2 600 \u20ac \/ mois<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"4045\" data-end=\"4184\">Ces niveaux permettent aux entreprises de structurer des \u00e9quipes performantes tout en optimisant leur budget dans des mod\u00e8les externalis\u00e9s.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-029df9a elementor-cta--layout-image-left elementor-cta--tablet-layout-image-above elementor-cta--mobile-layout-image-above elementor-cta--skin-classic elementor-animated-content elementor-bg-transform elementor-bg-transform-zoom-in elementor-widget elementor-widget-call-to-action\" data-id=\"029df9a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"call-to-action.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__bg-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__bg elementor-bg\" style=\"background-image: url(https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/Recrutez-des-stagiaires-travaillant-a-distance-copy-1024x541.webp);\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Recrutez-des-stagiaires-travaillant-a-distance-copy.webp\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__bg-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-cta__title elementor-cta__content-item elementor-content-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBreedj connecte les talents \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9chelle mondiale\t\t\t\t\t<\/h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__description elementor-cta__content-item elementor-content-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBreedj est la plateforme technologique qui structure, digitalise et simplifie l\u2019ensemble du processus de collaboration avec une communaut\u00e9 de talents distribu\u00e9e. De l\u2019identification des opportunit\u00e9s au suivi des performances, en passant par la gestion compl\u00e8te de la conformit\u00e9, Breedj offre un cadre transparent et s\u00e9curis\u00e9 pour travailler avec des talents externes.<\/br><\/br>\n\nPr\u00e9sente dans neuf pays et soutenant une communaut\u00e9 de professionnels qualifi\u00e9s, Breedj permet aux entreprises d\u2019acc\u00e9der \u00e0 des talents via des dispositifs externalis\u00e9s, \u00e0 distance, en t\u00e9l\u00e9travail ou en portage salarial, sans n\u00e9cessit\u00e9 de cr\u00e9er une entit\u00e9 locale.\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-cta__button-wrapper elementor-cta__content-item elementor-content-item \">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-cta__button elementor-button elementor-size-\" href=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/fr\/rejoignez-nous\/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDevenez membre Breedj\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-79b3bcb elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"79b3bcb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 data-section-id=\"185945\" data-start=\"4191\" data-end=\"4213\">D\u00e9fis et conformit\u00e9<\/h2><p data-start=\"4215\" data-end=\"4300\">Collaborer avec des talents bas\u00e9s au Rwanda implique de respecter les r\u00e8gles locales.<\/p><p data-start=\"4302\" data-end=\"4324\">Les principaux d\u00e9fis :<\/p><ul data-start=\"4326\" data-end=\"4423\"><li data-section-id=\"5rhark\" data-start=\"4326\" data-end=\"4350\">Conformit\u00e9 juridique<\/li><li data-section-id=\"cejj2t\" data-start=\"4351\" data-end=\"4375\">Gestion des contrats<\/li><li data-section-id=\"n9jmfo\" data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4398\">Gestion de la paie<\/li><li data-section-id=\"dyvr38\" data-start=\"4399\" data-end=\"4423\">Obligations sociales<\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"4425\" data-end=\"4588\"><strong data-start=\"4425\" data-end=\"4479\">Comment travailler l\u00e9galement sans entit\u00e9 locale ?<\/strong><br data-start=\"4479\" data-end=\"4482\" \/>Le mod\u00e8le Employer of Record (EOR) permet de d\u00e9l\u00e9guer ces aspects tout en s\u00e9curisant la collaboration.<\/p><h2 data-section-id=\"2mf19z\" data-start=\"4595\" data-end=\"4628\">Comment travailler avec Breedj<\/h2><p data-start=\"4630\" data-end=\"4748\">Breedj permet aux entreprises de structurer facilement des \u00e9quipes \u00e0 distance ou externalis\u00e9es dans un cadre conforme.<\/p><p data-start=\"4750\" data-end=\"4775\">Les solutions propos\u00e9es :<\/p><ul data-start=\"4777\" data-end=\"4887\"><li data-section-id=\"13qihnk\" data-start=\"4777\" data-end=\"4809\">Employer of Record (EOR)<\/li><li data-section-id=\"cjk8m3\" data-start=\"4810\" data-end=\"4834\">Portage salarial<\/li><li data-section-id=\"1phbtdj\" data-start=\"4835\" data-end=\"4866\">Freelances externalis\u00e9s<\/li><li data-section-id=\"3dtv64\" data-start=\"4867\" data-end=\"4887\">Sous-traitance<\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"4889\" data-end=\"4913\">Breedj prend en charge :<\/p><ul data-start=\"4915\" data-end=\"5043\"><li data-section-id=\"ki6c49\" data-start=\"4915\" data-end=\"4940\">La gestion de la paie<\/li><li data-section-id=\"m5iwma\" data-start=\"4941\" data-end=\"4979\">La conformit\u00e9 juridique et sociale<\/li><li data-section-id=\"1hek1kk\" data-start=\"4980\" data-end=\"5009\">La gestion administrative<\/li><li data-section-id=\"3z8xj\" data-start=\"5010\" data-end=\"5043\">La mise en place des contrats<\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"5045\" data-end=\"5202\"><strong data-start=\"5045\" data-end=\"5092\">Breedj est-il un Employer of Record (EOR) ?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5092\" data-end=\"5095\" \/>Oui. Breedj propose des solutions compl\u00e8tes permettant de collaborer l\u00e9galement sans cr\u00e9er d\u2019entit\u00e9 locale.<\/p><p data-start=\"5204\" data-end=\"5325\"><strong data-start=\"5204\" data-end=\"5254\">O\u00f9 trouver des talents qualifi\u00e9s et v\u00e9rifi\u00e9s ?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5254\" data-end=\"5257\" \/>Au sein de la communaut\u00e9 de talents Breedj, pr\u00e9sente dans neuf pays.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7d77c5d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7d77c5d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\u00a0<\/h3><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Breedj facilite l\u2019acc\u00e8s aux talents <br \/>rwandais dans un cadre conforme.<\/h3><p>\u00a0<\/p><div>\u00a0<\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-400abf7 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"400abf7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-md\" href=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/fr\/rejoignez-nous\/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Devenez membre Breedj<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/d